## Claim
Text: "For a cumulative 29 of our 60 years of existence as a nation, we have been under military rule."
Claim author: Muhammadu Buhari
Claim date: October 01, 2020
Claim origin: https://web.archive.org/web/20210118154309/https://www.channelstv.com/2020/10/01/nigeria-at-60-president-buharis-independence-anniversary-speech-full-text/

## Initial Q&A
### On what date did Nigeria achieve independence from British colonial rule, establishing the start of its existence as a sovereign nation?
Answer: Nigeria achieved independence from British colonial rule on October 1, 1960, establishing the start of its existence as a sovereign nation.

Source URL: https://www.france24.com/en/20201001-from-self-rule-to-civil-war-nigeria-s-independence-60-years-on

